            Answer
            N$ 7.00

      (c)   Some   candidates   managed   to   score   marks   for   the   first   part   of   the   question,   However,   the   majority
            could not interpret the question well and failed to predict what will happen to the availability and price
            of maize but instead stated the laws of demand and supply.
